[gd_scene load_steps=13 format=3]

; AUTOCANNON — the Walker's main gun.
;
; IT HAS TO READ AS A DIFFERENT GUN FROM THE HEAVY MG AT A GLANCE. Both ride the
; same mount on the same turret, and until now they shared machine_gun_model and
; the same rifle sample, so a 60-damage cannon firing 3-5 rounds every half
; second was indistinguishable from a 22-damage MG firing 20 rounds a second.
; The player could not tell which gun was working.
;
; So the silhouette is deliberately the MG's inverted, part for part:
;
;   MG                            AUTOCANNON
;   slim jacket with cooling fins thick smooth barrel, no fins
;   side-slung belt box           TOP-MOUNTED box magazine
;   small conical flash hider     slotted muzzle brake, wider than the barrel
;   narrow receiver               deep receiver with a breech block
;
; The fins and the top magazine are the two that carry at distance; the rest is
; detail for when it is close.

